<p>
  The core has been overloaded with <strong>Deadly Doom&trade;</strong>! Collect
  points to keep it from destroying everything!
</p>
<h2>Controls</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Use the arrow keys, wasd, or a controller to move</li>
  <li>Press Escape / Backspace to return to the menu</li>
  <li>Press tab to disable bloom, useful if it is running slow</li>
  <li>Desktop users can press F4 / F11 to toggle fullscreen</li>
</ul>
